          "text": "Description: A witness reports an observation made with their family on February 26, 2011 at approximately 9:45 PM: All observe the movement of a glowing orange sphere with a sudden change in direction and disappearance into an ascending trajectory at a \"blinding\" speed. This observation has a low degree of strangeness as a high proportion of the described characteristics correspond to those of known phenomena often observed and reported to the GEIPAN: observation of a luminous flying lantern (see the investigation report).",
